titleStmt.title:
Agreement signed at Washington, June 3, 1918;
                        ratification advised by the Senate, June 24, 1918; ratified by the
                        President, September 20, 1918; ratified by Great Britain, July 15, 1918;
                        ratifications exchanged at Washington, September 24, 1918; proclaimed,
                        September 30, 1918

